    "innovation": "Using a multi-model ensemble, this paper reveals that land models disagree on the primary drivers of terrestrial carbon uptake and identifies a compensatory trade-off between CO\u2082 and temperature sensitivities, which undermines confidence in future carbon-climate feedback predictions.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
