            "paragraph": "In both regressions, similar to Cox et al.31, we excluded the years 1963, 1964, 1982, 1983, 1991, and 1992, which were heavily influenced by volcanic eruptions. Volcanic events can affect land sink strength through changes in diffuse radiation, which may or may not be considered by the models in the ensembles but would likely influence the mass-balance estimate as a constraint.",
